# Gitignore for the embedded staging directory.
#
# `make embed-lib` copies the canonical lib/ tree from the repo root into
# this directory before each build.  The copied content is NOT committed —
# the repo root lib/ is the single source of truth.
#
# Only the placeholder .keep files and this README are tracked; everything
# else is copied at build time and gitignored here.

# Ignore all real lib content (copied by `make embed-lib`)
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!**/.keep
